 "result": "I documented 12 repos this run: ascend, mohavetech-contracts-api, beesim-green, boba-breakeven-x8k4, dronesim, threat-atlas-v3, tilespinneratlas, arcade-backend, mohave-browser, qsr-tracker-backend, engine-companion, and phasewell-scope.\n\nEach got a CHANGELOG.md and README.md in one \"docs: scribe update\" commit, pushed to master. Dronesim already had a README written by a person, so I kept it and added the scribe sections below it.\n\nNone of the 12 hide their app in a subfolder, so no root vercel.json was needed.\n\nAbout 91 backfills remain, since 103 repos had no state entry at the start. The remaining repos with new commits are mostly echoes of the scribe's own earlier pushes. I added five new repos to repos.json that it lacked.\n\nEvery repo was reachable. The profile in sudosilo/sudosilo is rebuilt and pushed. State, repos, publish jobs, and the agent notes are in control-troll main as \"scribe state\". The release and topic jobs are queued in publish.json for the publish workflow.",
